1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
The haunted house
Penny enters at night through hinged doors and the connected staircase.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:20,000
A furnished world
Five indexed primitive families form furniture and articulated toys.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Inspect the three clues
Train 2, clock 5, blocks 7. The code opens the real toy-room doors.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Rescue through hierarchy
Penny activates two switches. Jessie rides Bullseye and dismounts onto the high platform.

5
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Buzz and the pursuit
The release removes a translucent barrier. The ghost follows Penny to the stairs.

6
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Live character takeover
Woody follows your input while the others continue. Zero releases ownership; N enters full manual mode.

7
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Directional, point and spot
Moonlight is directional; the lamp adds a point source and soft spotlight.

8
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Gouraud shading
Lighting is evaluated at vertices and interpolated across triangles.

9
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Phong shading
Interpolated normals are normalised before per-fragment illumination.

10
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Texture coordinates
UVs map wood, wallpaper, fabric and lunar craters onto shared geometry.

11
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Analytic ray tracing
A BVH accelerates exact primitive hits, shadows, mirror paths and straight transparency.

12
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:52,000
The entrance breaks
Buzz flies and aims. Only a nearest-hit laser impact releases six physical wood fragments.

13
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:00,000
The toys are safe
Every character is physically outside. The cast idles in the garden. Adiba Tahsin / 2107031 / CSE-4102.
